it (run with --verbose for details).\n     at: cleanup (core/object/object.cpp:2489)\n```\nI reviewed my code, but I couldn’t find any unsafe ownership or failure to free resources. These errors mostly occur when closing the game/editor window, and in varying order - sometimes they don’t appear at all. I tried to link them to images or TileMapLayer nodes in scenes, but my theory didn’t hold up.\n\nHowever, on dev4 I’m not getting any crashes in the editor because of these errors - even though the errors themselves are still reported.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2888528453/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2944289733","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106101#issuecomment-2944289733","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106101","id":2944289733,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6vfkvF","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_event